{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img alt=\"「PlayStation for figmaPLUS」評測！能感受遊戲歷史的高品質公仔，其壓倒性的重現度令人驚愕\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c2e6b4eecf34d04e1050493f97213ec13171452d39868b8625d42f07fe846fdb/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0ceb2cdb3781dc8ebfedc5354d167aa6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>「PlayStation for figmaPLUS」評測！能感受遊戲歷史的高品質公仔，其壓倒性的重現度令人驚愕</figcaption></figure><p>以「美麗」與「可動」完全並存為目標的新世代可動公仔系列「<strong>figma</strong>」<br/>能進一步拓展這種「figma」玩法的「<strong>PlayStation for figmaPLUS</strong>」於2026年9月發售。<br/>以下將評測雖為迷你尺寸卻高品質重現的各PlayStation產品公仔！</p><h2>「PlayStation for figmaPLUS」評測！以壓倒性高品質的公仔接觸PlayStation的歷史</h2><figure><img alt=\"「PlayStation for figmaPLUS」\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2de4f8c73b361e98facee4573b8e2d85658f9300a66bc08bd791a8ede5772360/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe2882c024d7040a996465a0e10b93688.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>「PlayStation for figmaPLUS」</figcaption></figure><p>以「 可動靈活、精美。 」為主題的新世代可動公仔系列「<strong>figma</strong>」<br/>從拓展「figma」玩法的「figmaPLUS」系列中，推出了套組商品<strong>「PlayStation」主機7種</strong>。<br/>與手邊的「figma」搭配，即可重現喜歡的角色享受PlayStation的樣子等各種情境。</p><h3>套組內容</h3><figure><img alt=\"套組內容\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8b84a527a52156d34d926348cb4cb3bf308585261f91d06fd86c25accc10b3d5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F07461b3c25146d89344bd87341982ee2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>套組內容</figcaption></figure><p></p><p>本套組收錄以下內容。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><ul><li><p>「PlayStation」</p></li><li><p>「PlayStation 2」</p></li><li><p>「PlayStation Portable」</p></li><li><p>「PlayStation 3」</p></li><li><p>「PlayStation Vita」</p></li><li><p>「PlayStation 4」</p></li><li><p>「PlayStation 5」</p></li><li><p>「記憶卡(PS1)」</p></li><li><p>「記憶卡(PS2)」</p></li><li><p>「PocketStation」</p></li><li><p>「PocketStation(開啟狀態)」</p></li><li><p>各控制器 1個</p></li><li><p>專用手腕 3種</p></li><li><p>各軟體 1片(「捉猴啦」「汪達與巨像」「全民高爾夫」「FREEDOM WARS」「多樂貓歡樂喵派對」「Bloodborne」「宇宙機器人」)</p></li><li><p>貼紙 sheet</p></li></ul><p>不只軟體與記憶卡，竟然還附有<strong>專用手腕</strong>！<br/>似乎也能讓「figma」系列的公仔握住控制器。</p><figure><img alt=\"能讓推角玩遊戲！？\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/84cd694de137600cd80e7ab76041d53a07cf623d18fcd2fb2adc483f47c93217/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Feee1a5e77e1825c2b8e6ef5b798f7d04.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>能讓推角玩遊戲！？</figcaption></figure><p>這次將帶來開箱本套組的過程！<br/>究竟品質如何，開箱前就讓人期待高漲・・・。</p><h2>那麼，開箱。</h2><figure><img alt=\"來吧！\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f616e1c68b645e3404199aebee8f2806aafc6b9b66ded0eb87903f8a06a32c1d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2a1262599fda3dbab8cabb938b38e71d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>來吧！</figcaption></figure><p>那麼立刻開箱！</p><figure><img alt=\"迷你尺寸！\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b17dbf9170a681c6866ec2131b7767c7b931be4a43aa3b85be2f4fe2a981ce94/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F258f54bd6693d620ac77ba3a23e529f5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>迷你尺寸！</figcaption></figure><p>雖然從外面就知道，但其<strong>小巧</strong>仍令人驚訝！<br/>這可說是執念的品質，令人脫帽致敬・・・。</p><figure><img alt=\"與實物比較\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c29ece1eb9d49adf319b3b60777ed35e49ae1b300ff143fb20a3e8595cc46639/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F12bfbeed26641a233d259c70390267d1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>與實物比較</figcaption></figure><p>與實際的PlayStation 5控制器相比就是這個尺寸感。<br/>可以看出真的做得非常小巧精緻。</p><figure><img alt=\"重現有線連接！\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/41de752a874d5dd6f05727735c03450948581fd87332f5fa49576c337cfb2a94/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F31acabcea73f914f0791362799e207a7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>重現有線連接！</figcaption></figure><p>厲害的不只是外觀的重現度。<br/>竟然初代PlayStation與PlayStation 2能重現本體與控制器的<strong>有線連接</strong>。<br/>能看到彷彿當時遊玩體驗甦醒的光景。</p><figure><img alt=\"橫放用支架\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4140352bc48bc9fd555284b3db26a259fa9af19d19566e3ee14d5725dcd519cc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F4a2347e5c19f36abaf2a1038de65ce65.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>橫放用支架</figcaption></figure><p>此外，PlayStation 5還附有<strong>橫放用支架</strong>！<br/>筆者買本體時也曾受它照顧，這份徹底程度令人驚訝。</p><figure><img alt=\"實體版貼紙\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3602ddd52f2f3e9a4d307cf57f69d8652cb8cca6e2675361974d81742b07b897/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb042a0a70c7b371f6faeaeeb92a09253.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>實體版貼紙</figcaption></figure><p>然後還有某種貼紙・・・。<br/>各世代的遊戲實體版都有印刷！</p><figure><img alt=\"開始貼上！\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/38fff5fb9104f6947f83999759fc15c27b997172dca3989e2ae2291f79569469/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff66733f358c0764bd8cf598ad32e4ac8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>開始貼上！</figcaption></figure><p>依照說明書指示貼上吧。</p><figure><img alt=\"完成！\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/52b4c6602b8fc18daf5ef4b2a1d9008fcb9c69ccc04ca9407faca112d246a450/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6051e7a50d88e0c22dcc001ca4b7c424.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>完成！</figcaption></figure><p>・・・完成了！<br/>從懷念的軟體到最新的遊戲一字排開！<br/>若有玩過的作品，更是讓人情緒高漲呢。</p><figure><img alt=\"連這種地方也重現！\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/228638ae61d0cda5bb562867801cda23636019be70486b5f25d1f23a3242303c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8a8214cb427034672bb7975cb9a13ac0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>連這種地方也重現！</figcaption></figure><p>竟然初代PlayStation也能重現放入遊戲光碟！<br/>到了這個地步，感覺好像真的能遊玩遊戲呢。</p><figure><img alt=\"手腕\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/96707e6d8001fcbe004bcf9e24bb6aeea82edba3b6898de647471086edcc8cc2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F51a3816fb19d20f358fb372448039801.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>手腕</figcaption></figure><p>然後是那個手腕。</p><figure><img alt=\"能牢牢握住\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/15e41164de79fb17dfdaa2f99cedb1c8524c174e32ab88c972c906b1a50638cb/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8a6d9924a008511bbb9806729f669e0e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>能牢牢握住</figcaption></figure><p>只有手腕的話有點超現實・・・<br/>請務必讓手邊的推角公仔玩遊戲！</p><h3>透過figma回顧PlayStation的歷史吧！</h3><figure><img alt=\"感受歷史・・・\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8a3b313d199a662af8002dc2b2f7d7609c9cf6e88e390018381f596f87f61612/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff5b7d7159e29e03d924de1d8d08c09a3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>感受歷史・・・</figcaption></figure><p>最後來看看各世代的遊戲吧！</p><figure><img alt=\"PlayStation\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ffd83fe6d3b51792a8f4d7b41bfc2dcacf0c41a72f760e8c42eb250e8bf23fa4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F510f20ba84f1c580f61f9ac10d407d2b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>PlayStation</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"PlayStation 2\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8c145d426c37162dacf7389dfba529781806a1df0f9beeffa7a3abec6684ac03/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5cfc2b8e12a563fbcbcbb87c311e8dc2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>PlayStation 2</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"PlayStation 3\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8d36abc788d0e1a51ad8188e2179361bc148235c20972cf73f661c39ff972a4b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F705ad45d1660f1cd93e09b36bfda27a9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>PlayStation 3</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"PlayStation 4\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7c618148d0806178485d587eb8992418fb29ed6f31988c9186495b91cd83e18a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F82c34290e1c0aed55c65aaf3695de97d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>PlayStation 4</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"PlayStation 5\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/158e669a0787e0abb2ed3930655aaaa256a9ef55276ad7efb2167962cb6262f3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F3a472a0aa796fa491a8ddf786673a3f4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>PlayStation 5</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"PlayStation Portable與PlayStation Vita\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f74c8d9576f32c07e48767432a0cfa95d261a2b1f3b7b924cf753a576057ceb5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff878de4ee9887a4203f7bad5c416e369.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>PlayStation Portable與PlayStation Vita</figcaption></figure><p>・・・無論哪個世代，肯定都是某人充滿回憶的遊戲呢！<br/>這樣依序回顧遊戲歷史，總覺得會沉浸在感傷之中。</p><figure><img alt=\"想裝飾在家裡！\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/66c78c8d96b5d93fb12962f2446720b6e9aa324b6994e177134204dc09a0075c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fcf8f48ceb597857a4139dc4b1583e79b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>想裝飾在家裡！</figcaption></figure><p>本公仔不僅推薦給「figma」粉絲，也非常推薦給PlayStation粉絲！<br/>不妨將能感受PlayStation歷史的本產品排列在家中吧。<br/>本產品詳情可於<a href=\"https://www.playstation.com/ja-jp/local/official-products/playstation-goods/playstation-for-figmaplus/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PlayStation官方網站</a>、<a href=\"https://www.goodsmile.com/ja/product/1140798/PlayStation+for+figmaPLUS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Good Smile Company官方商店</a>確認！<br/>以上是「PlayStation for figmaPLUS」的評測！</p><p>The post <a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/review/playstation-for-figmaplus/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">「PlayStation for figmaPLUS」評測！能感受遊戲歷史的高品質公仔，其壓倒性的重現度令人驚愕</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Saiga NAK</a>. </p><hr/><h4>延伸閱讀</h4><p><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/ps-plus-freeplay-addition-nov2026/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸2026年11月PlayStation Plus 免費遊戲陣容新增包括「古墓奇兵IV-VI 重製版」等3部作品！</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/product/ps5-dualsense-prism-collection-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸PS5週邊設備推出採用半透明設計的全新配色「Prism Collection」！高級的光澤質感</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/release/ffrs/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「Final Fantasy Resonance」於10月22日發售！以HD-2D復甦的像素FF</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/where-the-seeds-fall-demo-available/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸《崩落之國》Steam 體驗版 10 月 16 日開放下載！挑戰高難度「向下探索」動作玩法</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/release/castlevania-belmonts-curse/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸《惡魔城：貝爾蒙特的詛咒》於 10 月 15 日發售！親筆簽名海報、電競電腦等好禮抽獎活動同步登場</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:44:35.085327+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2002,"images":23,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T07:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T09:59:27.444643+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:40:22.170841+00:00","content_hash":"d3bd3ef8980c7fb2857fa415ceabdda905c5e9fa4b20eec1e35c65eb95da28e6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}